---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Blogs - IPO, Mutual Fund & Finance Tools Guide | IPOfins" description="Complete guide to IPO investing, mutual funds, and finance tools. FAQs, how-tos, and strategies for Indian investors.">
  <nav class="container-wide pt-6" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
    <ol class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-surface-500 dark:text-surface-400">
      <li><a href="/" class="hover:text-primary-600 transition-colors">Home</a></li>
      <li><span class="mx-1">/</span></li>
      <li class="text-surface-900 dark:text-white font-medium">Blogs</li>
    </ol>
  </nav>

  <section class="container-wide pt-8 pb-6">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-surface-900 dark:text-white">Blogs & Guides</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 text-surface-600 dark:text-surface-300">Everything you need to know about IPOs, mutual funds, and financial tools — answered.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="container-wide py-6">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
      <a href="/blogs/ipo" class="card group block text-center hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow">
        <div class="w-14 h-14 mx-auto bg-primary-100 dark:bg-primary-900/30 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
          <span class="text-2xl">📈</span>
        </div>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-surface-900 dark:text-white group-hover:text-primary-600 transition-colors">IPO Guide</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-surface-500 mt-2">How to apply, GMP, allotment, risks, tax — 30+ FAQs answered</p>
        <p class="text-xs text-primary-600 mt-3 font-medium">Read IPO FAQs →</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/blogs/mutual-funds" class="card group block text-center hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow">
        <div class="w-14 h-14 mx-auto bg-success-50 dark:bg-success-500/10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
          <span class="text-2xl">💰</span>
        </div>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-surface-900 dark:text-white group-hover:text-primary-600 transition-colors">Mutual Fund Guide</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-surface-500 mt-2">SIP, returns, taxation, risk, best funds — 30+ FAQs answered</p>
        <p class="text-xs text-primary-600 mt-3 font-medium">Read MF FAQs →</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/blogs/tools" class="card group block text-center hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow">
        <div class="w-14 h-14 mx-auto bg-warning-50 dark:bg-warning-500/10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
          <span class="text-2xl">🔧</span>
        </div>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-surface-900 dark:text-white group-hover:text-primary-600 transition-colors">Tools Guide</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-surface-500 mt-2">SIP calculator, CAGR, EMI, IPO profit, risk — 40+ FAQs answered</p>
        <p class="text-xs text-primary-600 mt-3 font-medium">Read Tools FAQs →</p>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FAQ Section -->
  <section class="container-wide py-8">
    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-surface-900 dark:text-white mb-6">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
    <div class="space-y-4 max-w-3xl">
      <details class="card group" open>
        <summary class="cursor-pointer font-medium text-surface-900 dark:text-white">What topics do IPOfins blogs cover?</summary>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-surface-600 dark:text-surface-300">Our blogs cover three main areas: IPO-related FAQs (how to apply, GMP, allotment process, listing gains), Mutual Fund guidance (SIP, ELSS, direct vs regular plans, taxation), and Tools & Calculators (how to use SIP calculator, EMI planning, CAGR calculation). Each blog is written as an FAQ format for quick answers.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="card group">
        <summary class="cursor-pointer font-medium text-surface-900 dark:text-white">Are these blogs written by financial experts?</summary>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-surface-600 dark:text-surface-300">Our content is researched from official sources (SEBI guidelines, AMFI data, AMC publications) and written for retail investors. We are not SEBI-registered advisors. Our blogs explain concepts and processes — for personalized investment advice, always consult a certified financial planner.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="card group">
        <summary class="cursor-pointer font-medium text-surface-900 dark:text-white">How often are blogs updated?</summary>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-surface-600 dark:text-surface-300">We update our FAQs and guides whenever regulations change (tax rules, SEBI circulars, new IPO processes). Factual data like current interest rates, tax slabs, and fund performance are reviewed quarterly to keep information accurate.</p>
      </details>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
